caption:
Run leg and finally crossing the finish line. 😍🏅🔥

The final leg is no joke. It’s both physical and mental game. Maintained my goal pace until the 13km because I felt stifness on my left leg and fatigue started to eat me. Stayed composed and slowed my pace and told to myself to take it easy, don’t overuse your legs and just finish the race. “You got this!”

Crossing the finish line is where all emotions kick in. I’m dead tired and fulfilled at the same time! I didn’t how long I smiled after I crossed that line. 🥰😍🙏 

21km run time - 2hrs 4 mins and 53 seconds

